OL,3,GNEWSAVenues strike back against AI
OL,4,Agenerated artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities in the West of England are
OL,7,Ftaking a stance against the use of
OL,8,FAI-generated artwork.
OL,10,FCafe Kino, based in Stokes Croft,
OL,11,FBristol, has become the latest venue to
OL,12,Fban AI-generated posters, while the
OL,13,FUniversity of Bristol Students' Union
OL,14,Fhas banned AI artwork at its Freshers
OL,15,FWeek poster sale.
OL,17,FBristol-based live music venue Zed
OL,18,FAlley also banned AI artwork on its
OL,19,Fsocial media channels last month,
OL,20,Fciting ethical concerns and a lack of
OL,21,Foriginality.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
