OL,3,GNEWSAVenues strike back against AI
OL,4,Agenerated artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It fundamentally is terrible for the
OL,7,Fenvironment, and it takes the work out
OL,8,Fof the hands of graphic designers,"
OL,9,Fsaid Chris Illingworth, who manages the
OL,10,Fvenue's social media platforms.
